{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260702-0001", "kind": "decision", "text": "Decision: the job queue is Redis Streams with consumer groups, not RabbitMQ, because the team already runs Redis.", "area": "queue", "happened_at": "2026-07-02", "learned_at": "2026-07-02T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-02", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260702-0002", "kind": "decision", "text": "Decision: PostgreSQL 16 is the only database. No MongoDB side store for tracking events.", "area": "db", "happened_at": "2026-07-02", "learned_at": "2026-07-02T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-02", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260706-0003", "kind": "decision", "text": "Decision: the public API is versioned in the URL path (/v1/...), not with a header.", "area": "api", "happened_at": "2026-07-06", "learned_at": "2026-07-06T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-06", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260708-0004", "kind": "decision", "text": "Decision: API clients authenticate with signed bearer tokens, not session cookies.", "area": "auth", "happened_at": "2026-07-08", "learned_at": "2026-07-08T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-08", "basis": "told", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260709-0005", "kind": "decision", "text": "Decision: tracking events are append-only. A correction is a new event, never an update.", "area": "events", "happened_at": "2026-07-09", "learned_at": "2026-07-09T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-09", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260714-0006", "kind": "decision", "text": "Decision: list endpoints use cursor pagination with an opaque cursor, never page numbers.", "area": "api", "happened_at": "2026-07-14", "learned_at": "2026-07-14T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-14", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260714-0007", "kind": "decision", "text": "Decision: all timestamps are stored in UTC and sent as ISO 8601 strings.", "area": "db", "happened_at": "2026-07-14", "learned_at": "2026-07-14T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-14", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260715-0008", "kind": "decision", "text": "Decision: shipment ids are ULIDs made by the service, not database serial numbers.", "area": "db", "happened_at": "2026-07-15", "learned_at": "2026-07-15T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-15", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260721-0009", "kind": "decision", "text": "Decision: we deploy with rolling updates, two pods at a time, and no blue-green setup.", "area": "deploy", "happened_at": "2026-07-21", "learned_at": "2026-07-21T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-21", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260722-000a", "kind": "decision", "text": "Decision: logs are JSON lines on stdout. The platform ships them; the app writes no log files.", "area": "ops", "happened_at": "2026-07-22", "learned_at": "2026-07-22T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-22", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260728-000b", "kind": "decision", "text": "Decision: feature flags live in the config table and are read once per request; no flag service.", "area": "config", "happened_at": "2026-07-28", "learned_at": "2026-07-28T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-28", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260803-000c", "kind": "decision", "text": "Decision: raw carrier webhook payloads are kept 90 days, then deleted by a nightly job.", "area": "events", "happened_at": "2026-08-03", "learned_at": "2026-08-03T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-03", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260804-000d", "kind": "decision", "text": "Decision: customer notifications are sent by the worker through the email provider's HTTP API, not SMTP.", "area": "notify", "happened_at": "2026-08-04", "learned_at": "2026-08-04T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-04", "basis": "told", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260805-000e", "kind": "lesson", "text": "Bug fix: duplicate shipments were created when a client retried a POST. Fixed by requiring an Idempotency-Key header and storing it with a unique index.", "area": "api", "happened_at": "2026-08-05", "learned_at": "2026-08-05T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-05", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260806-000f", "kind": "lesson", "text": "Bug fix: the nightly export timed out because the query scanned the whole events table. Fixed with an index on events(created_at) and by exporting in 10000 row chunks.", "area": "reports", "happened_at": "2026-08-06", "learned_at": "2026-08-06T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-06", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260811-0010", "kind": "lesson", "text": "Bug fix: workers hung after a Redis failover because the connection pool kept dead sockets. Fixed by a socket health check every 30 seconds.", "area": "queue", "happened_at": "2026-08-11", "learned_at": "2026-08-11T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-11", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260812-0011", "kind": "lesson", "text": "Bug fix: carrier webhooks were processed twice when the carrier retried. Fixed by storing the carrier event id under a unique constraint and ignoring repeats.", "area": "events", "happened_at": "2026-08-12", "learned_at": "2026-08-12T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-12", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260813-0012", "kind": "lesson", "text": "Bug fix: delivery estimates were off by a day for far east time zones. The code used the server's local date; it now converts with the destination's time zone.", "area": "tracking", "happened_at": "2026-08-13", "learned_at": "2026-08-13T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-13", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260818-0013", "kind": "lesson", "text": "Bug fix: memory grew until the API pod was killed. A global dict cached every label PDF; it was replaced with an LRU cache capped at 200 entries.", "area": "api", "happened_at": "2026-08-18", "learned_at": "2026-08-18T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-18", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260819-0014", "kind": "lesson", "text": "Bug fix: the migration that added the carrier column locked the shipments table for minutes. Fixed by adding the column nullable, backfilling in batches, then adding the constraint.", "area": "db", "happened_at": "2026-08-19", "learned_at": "2026-08-19T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-19", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260820-0015", "kind": "lesson", "text": "Bug fix: flaky test test_label_render failed on CI only. It depended on the system font; the test now bundles a font file.", "area": "testing", "happened_at": "2026-08-20", "learned_at": "2026-08-20T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-20", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260825-0016", "kind": "lesson", "text": "Bug fix: 500 errors on address lookup when a postcode had a trailing space. Input is now trimmed and validated in the request model.", "area": "api", "happened_at": "2026-08-25", "learned_at": "2026-08-25T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-25", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260826-0017", "kind": "lesson", "text": "Bug fix: the worker lost jobs on restart because it acknowledged a message before the work finished. It now acknowledges after the work succeeds.", "area": "queue", "happened_at": "2026-08-26", "learned_at": "2026-08-26T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-26", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260901-0018", "kind": "lesson", "text": "Bug fix: login tokens were rejected on one pod because its clock drifted. Added 30 seconds of leeway when checking expiry and turned on time sync on the nodes.", "area": "auth", "happened_at": "2026-09-01", "learned_at": "2026-09-01T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-09-01", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260902-0019", "kind": "lesson", "text": "Bug fix: CSV exports showed garbled names for non-ASCII characters. The file is now written as UTF-8 with a byte order mark so spreadsheets open it correctly.", "area": "reports", "happened_at": "2026-09-02", "learned_at": "2026-09-02T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-09-02", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260903-001a", "kind": "lesson", "text": "Bug fix: the rate limiter counted health checks, so the load balancer got blocked. Health check paths are now exempt.", "area": "api", "happened_at": "2026-09-03", "learned_at": "2026-09-03T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-09-03", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260610-001b", "kind": "rule", "text": "Pull requests are merged with squash and merge. Rebase and merge is not used.", "area": "git", "happened_at": "2026-06-10", "learned_at": "2026-06-10T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-10", "basis": "told", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260610-001c", "kind": "fact", "text": "Branch names follow type/short-description, for example fix/label-timeout.", "area": "git", "happened_at": "2026-06-10", "learned_at": "2026-06-10T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-10", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260611-001d", "kind": "fact", "text": "Commit messages use the imperative mood and the first line stays under 72 characters.", "area": "git", "happened_at": "2026-06-11", "learned_at": "2026-06-11T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-11", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260611-001e", "kind": "fact", "text": "Every pull request description links its ticket and says how it was tested.", "area": "git", "happened_at": "2026-06-11", "learned_at": "2026-06-11T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-11", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260612-001f", "kind": "rule", "text": "Database migrations go in migrations/ with a timestamp prefix. Never edit a migration that has been merged.", "area": "db", "happened_at": "2026-06-12", "learned_at": "2026-06-12T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-12", "basis": "told", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260612-0020", "kind": "fact", "text": "Python code is formatted with Ruff; the CI job fails on any difference.", "area": "style", "happened_at": "2026-06-12", "learned_at": "2026-06-12T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-12", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260613-0021", "kind": "fact", "text": "Tests live in tests/ and mirror the package layout; each module has a matching test_ file.", "area": "testing", "happened_at": "2026-06-13", "learned_at": "2026-06-13T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-13", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260613-0022", "kind": "fact", "text": "Error responses use the shape {code, message, request_id}; code is a stable machine readable string.", "area": "api", "happened_at": "2026-06-13", "learned_at": "2026-06-13T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-13", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260614-0023", "kind": "fact", "text": "Configuration comes from environment variables only. A new variable is added to .env.example in the same PR.", "area": "config", "happened_at": "2026-06-14", "learned_at": "2026-06-14T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-14", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260615-0024", "kind": "fact", "text": "Releases are tagged vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH from main, and the changelog is updated in the release PR.", "area": "release", "happened_at": "2026-06-15", "learned_at": "2026-06-15T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-15", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260615-0025", "kind": "rule", "text": "Secrets are never committed. They live in the platform secret store and are mounted at runtime.", "area": "security", "happened_at": "2026-06-15", "learned_at": "2026-06-15T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-15", "basis": "told", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260616-0026", "kind": "fact", "text": "Public endpoints need an OpenAPI description before they ship.", "area": "api", "happened_at": "2026-06-16", "learned_at": "2026-06-16T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-16", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260617-0027", "kind": "preference", "text": "Prefer small PRs under 400 changed lines. Split bigger work into stacked PRs.", "area": "git", "happened_at": "2026-06-17", "learned_at": "2026-06-17T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-17", "basis": "told", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260617-0028", "kind": "preference", "text": "Prefer plain SQL with a thin query helper over an ORM for reporting queries.", "area": "db", "happened_at": "2026-06-17", "learned_at": "2026-06-17T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-17", "basis": "told", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260618-0029", "kind": "preference", "text": "Prefer dataclasses or Pydantic models over loose dicts for data passed between modules.", "area": "style", "happened_at": "2026-06-18", "learned_at": "2026-06-18T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-18", "basis": "told", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260618-002a", "kind": "preference", "text": "Prefer full names over short forms in code: write shipment, not shp.", "area": "style", "happened_at": "2026-06-18", "learned_at": "2026-06-18T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-18", "basis": "told", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260619-002b", "kind": "preference", "text": "Prefer running a single test file while working, and the full suite only before pushing.", "area": "testing", "happened_at": "2026-06-19", "learned_at": "2026-06-19T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-19", "basis": "told", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260619-002c", "kind": "preference", "text": "Prefer the standard library over a new dependency for small helpers. Ask before adding a package.", "area": "deps", "happened_at": "2026-06-19", "learned_at": "2026-06-19T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-19", "basis": "told", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260620-002d", "kind": "preference", "text": "Docs use short plain sentences with one instruction per sentence.", "area": "docs", "happened_at": "2026-06-20", "learned_at": "2026-06-20T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-20", "basis": "told", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260620-002e", "kind": "preference", "text": "Prefer fixing the cause over adding a retry or a try/except that hides an error.", "area": "style", "happened_at": "2026-06-20", "learned_at": "2026-06-20T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-20", "basis": "told", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260621-002f", "kind": "preference", "text": "Prefer alerts that stay quiet at night. Page only for customer-facing outages.", "area": "ops", "happened_at": "2026-06-21", "learned_at": "2026-06-21T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-21", "basis": "told", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260621-0030", "kind": "preference", "text": "The reviewer likes a short summary of risks at the top of each PR description.", "area": "git", "happened_at": "2026-06-21", "learned_at": "2026-06-21T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-21", "basis": "told", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260622-0031", "kind": "fact", "text": "Tests run with unittest via python -m unittest.", "area": "testing", "happened_at": "2026-06-22", "learned_at": "2026-06-22T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-22", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260828-0032", "kind": "fact", "text": "Tests run with pytest. The unittest runner was dropped in August.", "area": "testing", "happened_at": "2026-08-28", "learned_at": "2026-08-28T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-28", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260622-0033", "kind": "fact", "text": "The service runs on Python 3.10.", "area": "runtime", "happened_at": "2026-06-22", "learned_at": "2026-06-22T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-22", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260910-0034", "kind": "fact", "text": "The service runs on Python 3.12 since the September upgrade.", "area": "runtime", "happened_at": "2026-09-10", "learned_at": "2026-09-10T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-09-10", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260623-0035", "kind": "fact", "text": "Deploys to production happen on Fridays at 16:00.", "area": "deploy", "happened_at": "2026-06-23", "learned_at": "2026-06-23T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-23", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260912-0036", "kind": "rule", "text": "Production deploys are frozen on Fridays. Ship Tuesday to Thursday, before 15:00.", "area": "deploy", "happened_at": "2026-09-12", "learned_at": "2026-09-12T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-09-12", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260624-0037", "kind": "fact", "text": "Access tokens expire after 60 minutes.", "area": "auth", "happened_at": "2026-06-24", "learned_at": "2026-06-24T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-24", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260915-0038", "kind": "fact", "text": "Access tokens expire after 15 minutes. Refresh tokens last 30 days.", "area": "auth", "happened_at": "2026-09-15", "learned_at": "2026-09-15T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-09-15", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260624-0039", "kind": "fact", "text": "Application logs are kept for 7 days.", "area": "ops", "happened_at": "2026-06-24", "learned_at": "2026-06-24T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-24", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260916-003a", "kind": "fact", "text": "Application logs are kept for 30 days since the audit request.", "area": "ops", "happened_at": "2026-09-16", "learned_at": "2026-09-16T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-09-16", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260625-003b", "kind": "fact", "text": "The service runs in a single region, eu-west.", "area": "deploy", "happened_at": "2026-06-25", "learned_at": "2026-06-25T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-25", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260922-003c", "kind": "fact", "text": "The service now runs in two regions, eu-west and us-east. The database primary stays in eu-west.", "area": "deploy", "happened_at": "2026-09-22", "learned_at": "2026-09-22T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-09-22", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260625-003d", "kind": "fact", "text": "Label printing uses carrier Alpha's SOAP API.", "area": "carriers", "happened_at": "2026-06-25", "learned_at": "2026-06-25T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-25", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260924-003e", "kind": "fact", "text": "Label printing uses carrier Alpha's REST API. The SOAP API was retired in September.", "area": "carriers", "happened_at": "2026-09-24", "learned_at": "2026-09-24T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-09-24", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260626-003f", "kind": "fact", "text": "Pull requests need two approvals before they merge.", "area": "git", "happened_at": "2026-06-26", "learned_at": "2026-06-26T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-26", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260829-0040", "kind": "fact", "text": "Pull requests need one approving review. This changed from two in August.", "area": "git", "happened_at": "2026-08-29", "learned_at": "2026-08-29T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-29", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260626-0041", "kind": "fact", "text": "Carrier rate lookups are cached for 1 hour.", "area": "carriers", "happened_at": "2026-06-26", "learned_at": "2026-06-26T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-26", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260925-0042", "kind": "decision", "text": "Decision: carrier rate lookups are cached for 10 minutes in Redis, because carriers change prices more often.", "area": "carriers", "happened_at": "2026-09-25", "learned_at": "2026-09-25T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-09-25", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260627-0043", "kind": "fact", "text": "List endpoints return 100 items per page by default.", "area": "api", "happened_at": "2026-06-27", "learned_at": "2026-06-27T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-27", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260926-0044", "kind": "fact", "text": "List endpoints return 50 items per page by default, and at most 200.", "area": "api", "happened_at": "2026-09-26", "learned_at": "2026-09-26T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-09-26", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260627-0045", "kind": "fact", "text": "Alerts page the on-call engineer by SMS.", "area": "ops", "happened_at": "2026-06-27", "learned_at": "2026-06-27T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-27", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260929-0046", "kind": "fact", "text": "Alerts page the on-call engineer through the chat app. SMS is only a backup.", "area": "ops", "happened_at": "2026-09-29", "learned_at": "2026-09-29T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-09-29", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260628-0047", "kind": "fact", "text": "Staging is reset from a production snapshot every Sunday.", "area": "env", "happened_at": "2026-06-28", "learned_at": "2026-06-28T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-28", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20261001-0048", "kind": "fact", "text": "Staging no longer holds production data. It uses generated test data only.", "area": "env", "happened_at": "2026-10-01", "learned_at": "2026-10-01T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-10-01", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260628-0049", "kind": "fact", "text": "Database backups run weekly.", "area": "db", "happened_at": "2026-06-28", "learned_at": "2026-06-28T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-06-28", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20261002-004a", "kind": "fact", "text": "Database backups run every night at 02:00 and are kept for 14 days.", "area": "db", "happened_at": "2026-10-02", "learned_at": "2026-10-02T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-10-02", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260703-004b", "kind": "fact", "text": "Duplicate customer accounts are merged by support in the admin page, not by a script.", "area": "support", "happened_at": "2026-07-03", "learned_at": "2026-07-03T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-03", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260704-004c", "kind": "fact", "text": "The nightly report emails a summary to the ops list at 06:00.", "area": "reports", "happened_at": "2026-07-04", "learned_at": "2026-07-04T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-04", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260705-004d", "kind": "fact", "text": "The export endpoint streams CSV rows and never builds the whole file in memory.", "area": "reports", "happened_at": "2026-07-05", "learned_at": "2026-07-05T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-05", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260707-004e", "kind": "fact", "text": "Redis runs as a managed service with a replica in the second zone.", "area": "queue", "happened_at": "2026-07-07", "learned_at": "2026-07-07T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-07", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260710-004f", "kind": "fact", "text": "Webhook signatures are checked with the shared secret from the secret store.", "area": "events", "happened_at": "2026-07-10", "learned_at": "2026-07-10T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-10", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260711-0050", "kind": "fact", "text": "Delivery estimates are shown to customers as a date range, never as a single day.", "area": "tracking", "happened_at": "2026-07-11", "learned_at": "2026-07-11T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-11", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260712-0051", "kind": "fact", "text": "Label PDFs are rendered from a template and stored for 30 days.", "area": "api", "happened_at": "2026-07-12", "learned_at": "2026-07-12T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-12", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260713-0052", "kind": "fact", "text": "Migrations run in the release job before the new pods start.", "area": "db", "happened_at": "2026-07-13", "learned_at": "2026-07-13T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-13", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260716-0053", "kind": "fact", "text": "CI runs on every push and takes about 6 minutes.", "area": "ci", "happened_at": "2026-07-16", "learned_at": "2026-07-16T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-16", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260717-0054", "kind": "fact", "text": "Address lookup uses the postal service's public dataset, refreshed monthly.", "area": "api", "happened_at": "2026-07-17", "learned_at": "2026-07-17T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-17", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260718-0055", "kind": "fact", "text": "Workers run 4 processes per pod and each process reads one stream.", "area": "queue", "happened_at": "2026-07-18", "learned_at": "2026-07-18T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-18", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260719-0056", "kind": "fact", "text": "Pods restart nightly at 03:00 to pick up node patches.", "area": "deploy", "happened_at": "2026-07-19", "learned_at": "2026-07-19T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-19", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260720-0057", "kind": "fact", "text": "The rate limiter allows 100 requests a minute per API key.", "area": "api", "happened_at": "2026-07-20", "learned_at": "2026-07-20T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-20", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260723-0058", "kind": "fact", "text": "Customer names may hold any Unicode character. The database encoding is UTF-8.", "area": "db", "happened_at": "2026-07-23", "learned_at": "2026-07-23T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-23", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260724-0059", "kind": "fact", "text": "Release notes are posted in the team channel after each deploy.", "area": "release", "happened_at": "2026-07-24", "learned_at": "2026-07-24T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-24", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260725-005a", "kind": "fact", "text": "Merged branches are deleted by the repository settings.", "area": "git", "happened_at": "2026-07-25", "learned_at": "2026-07-25T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-25", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260726-005b", "kind": "fact", "text": "The staging environment mirrors production at half the size.", "area": "env", "happened_at": "2026-07-26", "learned_at": "2026-07-26T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-26", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260729-005c", "kind": "trap", "text": "Trap: the local .env file is ignored by git. Copy .env.example when you start.", "area": "dev", "happened_at": "2026-07-29", "learned_at": "2026-07-29T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-29", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260730-005d", "kind": "trap", "text": "Trap: the test database is dropped and rebuilt on every pytest run, so never point it at a real one.", "area": "testing", "happened_at": "2026-07-30", "learned_at": "2026-07-30T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-07-30", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260905-005e", "kind": "event", "text": "The September outage lasted 40 minutes and came from an expired database certificate.", "area": "ops", "happened_at": "2026-09-05", "learned_at": "2026-09-05T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-09-05", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260906-005f", "kind": "lesson", "text": "Lesson: alerts without a runbook link get ignored. Every alert links its runbook.", "area": "ops", "happened_at": "2026-09-06", "learned_at": "2026-09-06T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-09-06", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260801-0060", "kind": "fact", "text": "The admin dashboard is read-only for support staff. Only admins can edit shipments.", "area": "admin", "happened_at": "2026-08-01", "learned_at": "2026-08-01T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-01", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260802-0061", "kind": "fact", "text": "Carrier Beta is used for returns only.", "area": "carriers", "happened_at": "2026-08-02", "learned_at": "2026-08-02T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-02", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260807-0062", "kind": "fact", "text": "The API's p95 latency target is 300 ms.", "area": "api", "happened_at": "2026-08-07", "learned_at": "2026-08-07T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-07", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260907-0063", "kind": "event", "text": "The team moved the stand-up to 09:30 in September.", "area": "team", "happened_at": "2026-09-07", "learned_at": "2026-09-07T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-09-07", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260808-0064", "kind": "fact", "text": "Customer-facing status pages are built from the tracking events table.", "area": "tracking", "happened_at": "2026-08-08", "learned_at": "2026-08-08T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-08", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260809-0065", "kind": "fact", "text": "The mobile app talks to the same public API as partners.", "area": "api", "happened_at": "2026-08-09", "learned_at": "2026-08-09T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-09", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260810-0066", "kind": "trap", "text": "Trap: Alpha's sandbox reports delivered after 60 seconds, which production never does.", "area": "carriers", "happened_at": "2026-08-10", "learned_at": "2026-08-10T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-10", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260814-0067", "kind": "fact", "text": "Shipment weights are stored in grams as integers.", "area": "db", "happened_at": "2026-08-14", "learned_at": "2026-08-14T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-14", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260815-0068", "kind": "fact", "text": "Postcodes are stored as text, never as numbers, because of leading zeros.", "area": "db", "happened_at": "2026-08-15", "learned_at": "2026-08-15T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-15", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260821-0069", "kind": "lesson", "text": "Lesson: a backfill run without a dry run once overwrote 3000 rows. Always run it with --dry-run first.", "area": "db", "happened_at": "2026-08-21", "learned_at": "2026-08-21T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-21", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260822-006a", "kind": "fact", "text": "Local development uses docker compose with PostgreSQL and Redis containers.", "area": "dev", "happened_at": "2026-08-22", "learned_at": "2026-08-22T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-22", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260823-006b", "kind": "event", "text": "Carrier Gamma was dropped in July because its tracking was unreliable.", "area": "carriers", "happened_at": "2026-08-23", "learned_at": "2026-08-23T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-23", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20260827-006c", "kind": "fact", "text": "Webhook secrets rotate every 90 days.", "area": "security", "happened_at": "2026-08-27", "learned_at": "2026-08-27T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "session:2026-08-27", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
